cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Data-Aware AI on LUMI
message: >-
  If you use this tutorial in teaching or in published work, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rahman
    given-names: Anis
    email: anis.rahman@csc.fi
    affiliation: CSC - IT Center for Science Ltd.
repository-code: "https://github.com/aniskhan25/data-aware-ai"
abstract: >-
  A hands-on tutorial for deciding how AI datasets should be inspected,
  packaged, placed, staged, and read efficiently on the LUMI supercomputer.
  The tutorial teaches a measurement method rather than a single recommended
  data format.
keywords:
  - LUMI
  - HPC
  - machine learning
  - data loading
  - Lustre
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
